[en.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION_PROGRESSING]
Build Strong

[en.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION_PROGRESSING_desc]
The exciting development blueprint has injected vitality and purpose into the entire Empire, but factories and roads cannot be left in the world of imagination, or at least they cannot look like they are left in the world of imagination. The little ponies of the Empire are enthusiastic, passionate, and must quickly and well realize the great blueprint planned by the designers. Move towards a better Equestria!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION_PROGRESSING]
脚踏实地

[zh.FOCUS_C01_RECONSTRUCTION_PROGRESSING_desc]
令人激动人心的发展蓝图为整个帝国注入了活力与目标，但一座座工厂和一条条道路不能仅仅停留在想象的世界，或者至少不能看起来仅仅停留在想象的世界。帝国的小马们热情高涨，抛头颅洒热血，务必又快又好地实现设计师们规划的伟大蓝图。向着更美好的小马利亚前进！

